---
import '../../styles.css';
import '../../approval.css';
import { brandHead } from '../../../scripts/seo.mjs';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffd2e6" />
    <title>Konfirmasi booking | Chii Nails</title>
    <Fragment set:html={brandHead()} />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/cormorant-garamond-latin-500.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/dm-sans-latin-variable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a href="#main" class="skip-link">Lewati ke permintaan booking</a>
    <header class="approval-header">
      <div class="approval-header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="approval-brand" aria-label="Chii Nails — Beranda"><img src="/images/logo-brand.webp" width="80" height="52" alt="Chii Nails Nail Art Studio" /></a>
        <a href="/" class="approval-back">Kembali ke website</a>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main id="main" class="approval-page" aria-busy="true">
      <h1>Permintaan booking.</h1>
      <p class="approval-lead">Tinjau detailnya, lalu terima atau batalkan permintaan.</p>

      <p id="approval-status" class="approval-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Memeriksa akses…</p>
      <noscript><p class="approval-notice">Aktifkan JavaScript untuk membuka permintaan ini. Tidak ada booking yang disetujui hanya dengan membuka tautan.</p></noscript>

      <section id="approval-signin-panel" class="approval-signin" aria-labelledby="approval-signin-title" hidden>
        <h2 id="approval-signin-title">Masuk sebagai pemilik.</h2>
        <p>Detail pelanggan hanya terlihat setelah akun Google Chii diverifikasi.</p>
        <button id="approval-signin" class="button approval-button" type="button">Lanjutkan dengan Google</button>
        <div id="approval-google-button" class="approval-google-button" hidden></div>
        <p class="approval-small">Jika tautan dibuka di WhatsApp dan halaman masuk tidak muncul, buka tautan ini di Chrome atau Safari.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="approval-request" class="approval-request" aria-labelledby="approval-request-title" hidden>
        <div class="approval-request-heading">
          <h2 id="approval-request-title">Ringkasan booking</h2>
          <span id="approval-state" class="approval-state"></span>
        </div>
        <dl class="approval-summary">
          <div><dt>Nama</dt><dd data-approval-value="name"></dd></div>
          <div><dt>WhatsApp</dt><dd><a data-approval-value="whatsapp" class="approval-contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Desain</dt><dd data-approval-value="design"></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Tanggal · WIB</dt><dd data-approval-value="date"></dd></div>
          <div><dt id="approval-duration-label">Waktu</dt><dd data-approval-value="time"></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Harga total</dt><dd data-approval-value="agreedPrice"></dd></div>
          <div><dt id="approval-payment-label">Pembayaran</dt><dd data-approval-value="deposit"></dd></div>
          <div class="approval-balance"><dt>Sisa pembayaran</dt><dd data-approval-value="remainingBalance"></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div id="approval-proof" class="approval-proof" hidden><button id="approval-proof-toggle" class="button button-secondary approval-button" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="approval-proof-image">Lihat bukti pembayaran</button><p id="approval-proof-status" class="approval-small" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p><img id="approval-proof-image" alt="Bukti pembayaran pelanggan" hidden /></div>
        <div id="approval-actions" class="approval-actions" hidden>
          <p id="approval-payment-note" class="approval-payment-note">Dengan menerima, kamu menyatakan nominal sudah sesuai konsultasi dan pembayaran sudah diterima. Jadwal akan diperiksa kembali sebelum ditambahkan ke kalender.</p>
          <button id="approval-accept" class="button approval-button" type="button">Terima booking</button>
          <button id="approval-cancel" class="button button-secondary approval-button" type="button">Batalkan permintaan</button>
        </div>
        <button id="approval-recover" class="button button-secondary approval-button" type="button" hidden>Periksa penyimpanan</button>
        <a id="approval-calendar-link" class="button button-secondary approval-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" hidden>Lihat di Google Calendar</a>
        <a id="approval-receipt-send" class="button approval-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" hidden>Send receipt via WhatsApp</a>
        <p id="approval-receipt-status" class="approval-small" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="approval-receipt-retry" class="text-link approval-retry" type="button" hidden>Siapkan tautan kuitansi lagi</button>
        <p id="approval-outcome" class="approval-outcome" hidden></p>
      </section>

      <button id="approval-retry" class="approval-retry text-link" type="button" hidden>Coba lagi</button>
      <p class="approval-footer">Membuka tautan ini tidak mengubah booking. <a class="text-link" href="/prices">Kelola harga</a></p>
    </main>
    <script src="../../scripts/approval-client.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
